Depends: libgdbm6
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://www.perl.org/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Perl 5.42 interpreter
 Built on-device for rootless jailbreaks. system, exec, backticks and
 piped open retry shebang spawn via /var/jb/bin/sh on EPERM, ENOEXEC
 and ENOENT. Does not link libiosexec.
 .
 Installs the versioned name perl5.42 only. Install perl-default to
 make perl on PATH mean this interpreter; that package supersedes the
 bootstrap's perl 5.32.
